WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:16.570
You might have noticed before you clicked
on this video that it is in fact about an

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:21.960
hour long, and that is because today, we are
going to give you a glimpse of what it’s

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:25.419
like to be one of our Patreon patrons.

00:00:25.419 --> 00:00:29.050
Our supporters on Patreon are the reason this
channel can exist.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:34.300
And when we say that at the end of our episodes,
it is not us being hyperbolic.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.390
Each and every one of the people who work
on this amazing team of writers, editors,

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:43.620
producers, musicians, and more really do rely
on that support.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:48.280
And over at patreon.com/journeytomicro, we’ve
got a couple of different tiers you can sign

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.833
up for, and with those tiers come rewards,

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:57.559
Our $8 a month patrons get a weekly hi-res
wallpaper they can use on their phone or desktop

00:00:57.559 --> 00:01:02.384
computer, and they also get their name listed
in the credits at the end of every video.

00:01:02.384 --> 00:01:06.960
But the other reward they get each month is
an hour long video of beautiful microscopic

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.220
footage, accompanied by Andrew Huang’s original
songs that he has created for this channel.

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:17.508
There’s no narration, it’s just the uncut
footage from the episodes we make,

00:01:17.508 --> 00:01:19.130
along with Andrew’s songs.

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:22.768
And, that reward is not exclusive to our $8
patrons.

00:01:22.768 --> 00:01:28.250
Our $2 a month patrons also have access to
the hour long uncut videos.

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:32.800
So whatever it is you’ve got to do today,
study, homework, hanging out with your cat,

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:41.070
we hope you get to relax and enjoy this unnarrated
hour of beautiful microscopic footage.

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:45.700
And if you want to be a part of helping this
channel continue to exist and get some fun

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:52.752
rewards along the way, please check out
Patreon.com/journeytomicro to sign up.

00:01:52.752 --> 00:01:54.324
Thank you, and enjoy!

